SUMMARY:GenX Takeover Comedy Tour LIVE at Route 66 Casino
DTSTAMP:20260711T054924Z
DTSTART:20260711T190000Z
DESCRIPTION:Official Tickets\nResale Tickets\n\nAbout the Performers\nThe G
	enX Takeover Comedy Tour is a powerhouse comedy showcase celebrating the h
	umor\, nostalgia\, and irreverence of Generation X. This touring comedy ev
	ent brings together some of the funniest voices from the Gen X era\, deliv
	ering a night of laughs that resonates with anyone who grew up in the 80s 
	and 90s. \nThe tour features comedians who draw on shared cultural touchst
	ones — from Saturday morning cartoons and mixtapes to dial-up internet and
	 the golden age of MTV. The humor is sharp\, self-aware\, and packed with 
	the kind of references that will have Gen X audiences laughing in recognit
	ion. \nWhether you’re a card-carrying Gen Xer or just appreciate great sta
	nd-up comedy\, this show delivers an unforgettable night of entertainment 
	that bridges generations through laughter. \nEvent Details\n\nDate: Saturd
	ay\, July 11\, 2026\nTime: 7:00 PM MDT\nVenue: Route 66 Casino\nAddress: 1
	4500 Central Ave SW\, Albuquerque\, NM 87121\nTicket Prices: Starting at $
	35+\nAge Restrictions: 21+ (casino property)\; content intended for mature
	 audiences\n\nAbout the Venue\nRoute 66 Casino is one of Albuquerque’s mos
	t iconic entertainment destinations\, located just west of the city along 
	historic Route 66. The casino’s entertainment venue offers a fantastic atm
	osphere for live comedy\, with excellent sightlines\, comfortable seating\
	, and a lively crowd that knows how to have a good time. \nThe Route 66 Ca
	sino entertainment center has hosted some of the biggest names in comedy a
	nd music\, making it a go-to destination for top-tier live entertainment i
	n New Mexico. The venue features full bar service\, casino gaming before a
	nd after the show\, and ample free parking on-site. \nThe casino is locate
	d at 14500 Central Ave SW\, approximately 15 miles west of downtown Albuqu
	erque. It’s easily accessible via I-40 and offers a full resort experience
	 with dining\, gaming\, and entertainment all under one roof. \nWhat to Ex
	pect\nThe GenX Takeover Comedy Tour is a multi-comedian showcase format\, 
	meaning you’ll get a full evening of comedy from several performers rather
	 than a single headliner. Expect a rotating lineup of hilarious comedians 
	who each bring their own unique perspective on Gen X life and culture. \nT
	he show runs approximately 2 hours and features a mix of storytelling\, ob
	servational humor\, and crowd interaction. It’s a perfect night out for gr
	oups of friends\, couples\, or anyone looking for a great time at one of A
	lbuquerque’s premier entertainment venues. \nArrive early to grab drinks\,
	 explore the casino floor\, and find your seats before the show begins. Th
	e Route 66 Casino entertainment venue fills up for popular shows\, so plan
	 to arrive at least 30 minutes before showtime. \nTicket Information\nTick
	et Prices: Starting at $35+ (prices vary by section\; VIP options availabl
	e) \nPurchase official tickets through Ticketmaster or find resale tickets
	 through VividSeats. Both options offer buyer protection and guaranteed de
	livery. \n\nOfficial Tickets\nResale Tickets\n\nThis post contains affilia
	te links. We earn a commission if you purchase tickets through our links a
	t no extra cost to you. \nAll sales are final. Show times subject to chang
	e. Valid photo ID may be required for entry.\n\nhttps://comedycalendar.com
	/event/genx-takeover-comedy-tour-live-at-route-casino/\n\nFrom Comedy Cale
	ndar
URL:https://comedycalendar.com/event/genx-takeover-comedy-tour-live-at-rout
	e-casino/
LOCATION:Route 66 Casino\, 14500 Central Ave SW\, Albuquerque\, New Mexico\
	, 87121\, United States
