DESCRIPTION:This post contains affiliate links. We earn a commission if you
	 purchase tickets through our links at no extra cost to you. \nOfficial Ti
	ckets\nResale Tickets \nSeth Meyers: Live LIVE at The Colosseum at Caesars
	 Windsor\nLate Night with Seth Meyers host and SNL veteran Seth Meyers bri
	ngs his acclaimed stand-up comedy to The Colosseum at Caesars Windsor\, ju
	st across the river from Detroit. Known for his sharp political wit\, inci
	sive commentary\, and brilliant comedic writing\, Seth Meyers delivers a l
	ive stand-up experience that goes beyond the desk. \nEvent Details\nDate: 
	Saturday\, July 11\, 2026\nTime: 8:00 PM\nVenue: The Colosseum at Caesars 
	Windsor\nAddress: 377 Riverside Drive East\, Windsor\, ON\, Canada\nAge Re
	quirement: All ages welcome\nNote: Valid passport or travel document requi
	red for border crossing \nAbout Seth Meyers\nSeth Meyers is the host of La
	te Night with Seth Meyers on NBC and a former head writer and Weekend Upda
	te anchor on Saturday Night Live. One of the sharpest comedic minds in the
	 business\, Meyers is celebrated for his political humor\, pop culture com
	mentary\, and masterful comedic timing. His live stand-up shows offer fans
	 a rare chance to see him perform outside the Late Night studio. \nWhat to
	 Expect\n\nSharp political wit and incisive social commentary\nStand-up ma
	terial from one of TV’s funniest minds\nA rare live performance from the L
	ate Night host\nAn intimate casino showroom experience\nEasy access from D
	etroit via the Ambassador Bridge or tunnel\nCasino dining and entertainmen
	t before the show\n\nVenue Information\nThe Colosseum at Caesars Windsor i
	s a world-class entertainment venue located at 377 Riverside Drive East in
	 Windsor\, Ontario\, directly across the Detroit River from downtown Detro
	it. \nTicket Information\nTickets from $135. Available via Ticketmaster (o
	fficial) or VividSeats (resale). Valid travel documents required for borde
	r crossing. \nOfficial Tickets\nResale Tickets \nThis post contains affili
	ate links. We earn a commission if you purchase tickets through our links 
	at no extra cost to you.\nAll sales are final. Show times subject to chang
	e. Valid photo ID may be required for entry.\n\nhttps://comedycalendar.com
	/event/seth-meyers-live-at-the-colosseum-at-caesars-windsor/\n\nFrom Comed
	y Calendar
URL:https://comedycalendar.com/event/seth-meyers-live-at-the-colosseum-at-c
	aesars-windsor/
