DTSTAMP:20260711T054924Z
DTSTART:20260712T180000Z
DESCRIPTION:This post contains affiliate links. We earn a commission if you
	 purchase tickets through our links at no extra cost to you. \nOfficial Ti
	ckets\nResale Tickets \nSammy Obeid LIVE at Howlin’ Wolf\nComedian Sammy O
	beid brings his acclaimed stand-up show to the iconic Howlin’ Wolf in New 
	Orleans on July 12\, 2026. Known for his sharp wit and unique perspective\
	, Sammy delivers a night of non-stop laughs you won’t want to miss. \nEven
	t Details\nDate: Sunday\, July 12\, 2026\nTime: 6:00 PM CDT (Doors open at
	 5:30 PM)\nVenue: Howlin’ Wolf\nAddress: 907 South Peters\, New Orleans\, 
	LA 70130\nAge Requirement: 18+ (Valid photo ID required) \nAbout Sammy Obe
	id\nSammy Obeid is a Lebanese-American stand-up comedian and actor known f
	or his record-breaking 1\,001 consecutive nights of stand-up comedy. He ha
	s appeared on NBC’s Last Comic Standing\, Conan\, and has toured extensive
	ly across the country\, earning a reputation for his clever\, high-energy 
	performances. \nWhat to Expect\n\nHigh-energy stand-up comedy from a natio
	nally recognized comedian\nSharp observational humor and personal storytel
	ling\nAn intimate venue experience at the legendary Howlin’ Wolf\nPresente
	d by Laugh Life Comedy\n18+ show — bring valid photo ID\nDoors open at 5:3
	0 PM\, show starts at 6:00 PM\n\nVenue Information\nHowlin’ Wolf is one of
	 New Orleans’ most beloved live entertainment venues\, located at 907 Sout
	h Peters in the heart of the city. Known for its intimate atmosphere and w
	orld-class acoustics\, it’s the perfect setting for a night of comedy. \nT
	icket Information\nTickets are priced at $41.41. Purchase official tickets
	 through Ticketmaster or find resale tickets on VividSeats. \nOfficial Tic
	kets\nResale Tickets \nThis post contains affiliate links. We earn a commi
	ssion if you purchase tickets through our links at no extra cost to you.\n
	All sales are final. Show times subject to change. Valid photo ID may be r
	equired for entry.\n\nhttps://comedycalendar.com/event/sammy-obeid-live-at
	-howlin-wolf/\n\nFrom Comedy Calendar
URL:https://comedycalendar.com/event/sammy-obeid-live-at-howlin-wolf/
LOCATION:Howlin’ Wolf\, 907 South Peters\, New Orleans\, LA\, 70130\, Unite
	d States Of America
