SUMMARY:Matt Rife: Stay Golden World Tour LIVE at Greek Theatre (July 12)
DTSTAMP:20260711T054924Z
DTSTART:20260712T193000Z
DESCRIPTION:Official TicketsResale Tickets \nComedy’s biggest social media 
	phenomenon\, Matt Rife\, brings his record-breaking Stay Golden World Tour
	 to the legendary Greek Theatre in Los Angeles for a second night — Sunday
	\, July 12\, 2026. \nKnown for his viral TikTok clips\, Netflix special Na
	tural Selection\, and his massive sold-out arena tours\, Matt Rife is one 
	of the hottest stand-up comedians in the world right now. A second show wa
	s added due to overwhelming demand — don’t miss your chance. \nAbout the G
	reek Theatre\nThe Greek Theatre is one of Los Angeles’ most beloved and ic
	onic outdoor amphitheaters\, nestled in Griffith Park at 2700 N Vermont Av
	e. With a capacity of 5\,900 and stunning natural surroundings\, it offers
	 an unmatched open-air summer concert experience under the stars. \nA warm
	 July night at the Greek Theatre watching one of comedy’s biggest stars — 
	it doesn’t get more LA than that. \nWhat to Expect\n\nHigh-energy stand-up
	 from one of the world’s most popular comedians\nBeautiful outdoor amphith
	eater setting in Griffith Park\n18+ / Mature Audience — valid ID required\
	nPreferred parking available — purchase in advance\nSaturday July 11 show 
	also available — check Ticketmaster for both dates\n\nEvent Details\n\nDat
	e: Sunday\, July 12\, 2026\nTime: 7:30 PM PDT\nVenue: Greek Theatre\, 2700
	 N Vermont Ave\, Los Angeles\, CA 90027\nTour: Stay Golden World Tour\nAge
	 Restriction: 18+ / Mature Audience\n\nTickets\nPrice: From $81 + fees (re
	sale prices vary) \nOfficial TicketsResale Tickets \nThis post contains af
	filiate links. We may earn a commission at no extra cost to you.\n\nhttps:
	//comedycalendar.com/event/matt-rife-stay-golden-world-tour-live-at-greek-
	theatre-july-twelve/\n\nFrom Comedy Calendar
URL:https://comedycalendar.com/event/matt-rife-stay-golden-world-tour-live-
	at-greek-theatre-july-twelve/
LOCATION:Greek Theater\, 2700 N Vermont Ave.\, Los Angeles\, CA\, 90027\, U
	nited States
