SUMMARY:J.Chris Newberg LIVE at Laugh Factory Las Vegas
DTSTAMP:20260711T054924Z
DTSTART:20260713T203000Z
DESCRIPTION:Official Tickets \nAbout the Performer\nJ.Chris Newberg is a un
	iquely talented comedian and musician who blends stand-up comedy with orig
	inal songs to create a one-of-a-kind live experience. Known for his quick 
	wit\, clever wordplay\, and infectious energy\, Newberg has built a devote
	d following through his hilarious musical comedy performances. \nHis shows
	 are a seamless mix of sharp observational humor and original comedic song
	s that leave audiences laughing and singing along. J.Chris has performed a
	t comedy clubs and festivals across the country\, earning a reputation as 
	one of the most entertaining and versatile performers on the circuit. His 
	ability to improvise and connect with audiences makes every show feel fres
	h and spontaneous. \nCatching J.Chris Newberg at the Laugh Factory in Las 
	Vegas is a must for fans of comedy that goes beyond the ordinary — expect 
	laughs\, music\, and an unforgettable night of entertainment. \nEvent Deta
	ils\n\nDate: Monday\, July 13\, 2026 (runs through July 19)\nTime: 8:30 PM
	\nVenue: Laugh Factory at Horseshoe Las Vegas\, 3645 S Las Vegas Blvd\, La
	s Vegas\, NV 89109\nShow Duration: Approximately 90 minutes\n\nAbout the V
	enue\nThe Laugh Factory at Horseshoe Las Vegas is a legendary comedy desti
	nation on the Las Vegas Strip. Part of the world-famous Laugh Factory bran
	d\, this venue brings top-tier stand-up comedy to the heart of Las Vegas i
	nside the iconic Horseshoe Hotel and Casino at 3645 S Las Vegas Blvd. \nTh
	e club offers an intimate setting with tiered seating\, full bar service\,
	 and excellent sightlines from every seat. The classic comedy club atmosph
	ere makes it one of the best places in Las Vegas to experience live stand-
	up comedy. With multiple shows per week featuring rotating headliners\, th
	e Laugh Factory is a go-to destination for comedy fans visiting the Strip.
	 \nParking is available at the Horseshoe Las Vegas parking garage. The ven
	ue is easily accessible from the Strip and surrounding hotels. \nWhat to E
	xpect\nJ.Chris Newberg’s Las Vegas residency at the Laugh Factory is a mul
	ti-night engagement featuring his signature blend of stand-up comedy and o
	riginal musical comedy. Each show is a high-energy\, laugh-filled experien
	ce that combines the best of both worlds — sharp comedy writing and live m
	usical performance. \nThe show runs approximately 90 minutes and may inclu
	de an opening act. Newberg’s ability to read the room and adapt his materi
	al ensures that every performance feels unique. Whether you’re a longtime 
	fan or seeing him for the first time\, you’re in for a genuinely entertain
	ing evening. \nTicket Information\nPrice Range: $30 – $55 (fees may apply)
	 \nTickets are available through Ticketmaster (official). Book early — Lau
	gh Factory shows sell out fast! \nOfficial Tickets \nThis post contains af
	filiate links. We may earn a commission at no extra cost to you.\n\nhttps:
	//comedycalendar.com/event/jchris-newberg-live-at-laugh-factory-las-vegas/
	\n\nFrom Comedy Calendar
URL:https://comedycalendar.com/event/jchris-newberg-live-at-laugh-factory-l
	as-vegas/
LOCATION:Laugh Factory at Horseshoe Las Vegas\, 3645 S Las Vegas Blvd\, Las
	 Vegas\, NV\, 89109\, USA
